<title>GREECE: Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, July 29.</title>
<headline>Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, July 29.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     July 29     July 28   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  287.140     288.400     247.020   16.24 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  308.590     308.710     306.830    0.57 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.450     156.145     158.970   -1.59 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.388	46.342	47.182   -1.68 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  468.660     476.360     419.180   11.80 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  138.835     138.715     141.685   -2.01 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.054	16.072	16.185   -0.81 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  244.190     245.960     212.430   14.95 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.855	 1.854	 1.888   -1.75 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.549	 1.549	 1.581   -2.02 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.370     189.680     183.135    3.40 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December 31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
